        "description": "Calling this method will alter the existing journeyKey. If you are cancelling the only segment in a journey,\nthis method will behave the same as calling DELETE on /api/nsk/v1/booking/journeys/{journeyKey}.\nIf there are segments remaining after the delete, the Location response header will be set with\nthe location of the modified journey with its new key.\nIMPORTANT: This endpoint should NOT be called concurrently using the same session token to avoid performance\nproblems.\n\nGraphQL endpoint: segmentDelete",
