          "booking/ssrs"
        ],
        "summary": "Resells any cancelled SSRs to the provided journey on the booking.",
        "description": "`IMPORTANT: This endpoint should NOT be called concurrently using the same session token to avoid performance\nproblems.`\nRelated Endpoints:\n- `GET /api/nsk/v1/booking/journeys`: Gets the collection of journeys on the booking in state.\n- `GET /api/nsk/v1/booking/ssrs`: Retrieves the current SSRs added to the booking in state.\n- `GET /api/nsk/v1/settings/general/codes`: Determines which roles are allowed to waive fees.\n\nGraphQL endpoint: resellSsrsv2",
        "operationId": "nsk_v2_booking_ssrs_resell_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "x-name": "request",
