        "description": "A flight must be within three days of leaving to be able to make flight\nfollowing information changes.\nAn empty string or whitespaces are allowed input values and are not considered as null\ninputs. Null values will retain the original value in the trip status while empty strings\nor whitespaces will clear the value from the trip status.\nWhen updating tail numbers, this endpoint will not validate mismatching equipment types.\nIf validation is required for tail numbers, please see `POST /equipment/tailNumber`.\n\nGraphQL endpoint: tripInformationStatusModify",
