        "tags": [
          "trip"
        ],
        "summary": "Sells the list of journeys and creates a booking if it doesn't already exist.",
        "description": "`IMPORTANT: This endpoint should NOT be called concurrently using the same session token to avoid performance\nproblems.`\nThis endpoint will ignore the contents of 'TripSellRequestv2.Passengers.Types.Details' if there are already\npassengers in the booking in state and use the existing passengers instead.\n\nGraphQL endpoint: tripAddv5",
